      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Step: GetSkidWeight (DataCollectionSteps = 5)\n\nControl: SkidWeight (UserControl, 427×369, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout:\n• label1: \"Skid Weight\" at y=142\n• label2: \"Enter in the skid weight\" at y=159\n• tbSkidWeight: 195×20 at (6,175) — main input\n• btnReReadScale: 97×23 at (104,201) — re-read scale\n• cbPartial: \"Partial Claim\" checkbox — hides for Combo\n• gbPartial: Partial Claim group (enabled when cbPartial checked)\n  - tbPartialQty: claim qty (Leave event saves)\n  - Enabled when IsPartialClaim or replacement skid\n• lblAlertToUser: blue alert for replacement skids (forced partial)\n• lblAlertToUser2: extended model number alert\n• gbWoodPalletWeight: Wood Pallet Weight override (conditional)\n• tbDebug: debug console (config EnableDebuggingHelpers)\n\nOn Load:\n• Populates lblSkidQty from SkidQuantity\n• If IsPartialClaim → enables partial controls\n• If replacement skid → forces partial, shows alert\n• If extended model number expected → shows alert2\n• If wood pallet override → shows gbWoodPalletWeight\n• Pulls weight from scale via PullWeightFromScale()",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Step: GetSkidWeight (DataCollectionSteps = 5)\n\nControl: SkidWeight (UserControl, 427×369, IDataCollectionControl)\n\nLayout:\n• label1: \"Skid Weight\" at y=142\n• label2: \"Enter in the skid weight\" at y=159\n• tbSkidWeight: 195×20 at (6,175) — main input\n• btnReReadScale: 97×23 at (104,201) — re-read scale\n• cbPartial: \"Partial Claim\" checkbox — hides for Combo\n• gbPartial: Partial Claim group (enabled when cbPartial checked)\n  - tbPartialQty: claim qty (Leave event saves)\n  - Enabled when IsPartialClaim or replacement skid\n• lblAlertToUser: blue alert for replacement skids (forced partial)\n• lblAlertToUser2: extended model number alert\n• gbWoodPalletWeight: Wood Pallet Weight override (conditional)\n• tbDebug: debug console (config EnableDebuggingHelpers)\n\nOn Load:\n• Populates lblSkidQty from SkidQuantity\n• If IsPartialClaim → enables partial controls\n• If replacement skid → forces partial, shows alert\n• If extended model number expected → shows alert2\n• If wood pallet override → shows gbWoodPalletWeight\n• Pulls weight from scale via PullWeightFromScale()",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-conditional",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
      "y": 350,
      "width": 366,
      "height": 120,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f59e0b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1035,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1035,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Conditional UI:\n\n• Combo variation: cbPartial & gbPartial HIDDEN\n• Replacement Skid Id: forces cbPartial=checked, enables gbPartial, disables cbPartial, shows lblAlertToUser\n• Extended Model Number: shows lblAlertToUser2 with both model numbers\n• Wood Pallet: shows gbWoodPalletWeight with DB pallet weight pre-filled\n• Debug: tbDebug visible only when config.EnableDebuggingHelpers\n\nValidation:\n• tbSkidWeight_TextChanged → validation\n• tbPartialQty_Leave → saves partial qty\n• tbWoodPalletWeight_KeyPress/KeyUp → numeric only",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Conditional UI:\n\n• Combo variation: cbPartial & gbPartial HIDDEN\n• Replacement Skid Id: forces cbPartial=checked, enables gbPartial, disables cbPartial, shows lblAlertToUser\n• Extended Model Number: shows lblAlertToUser2 with both model numbers\n• Wood Pallet: shows gbWoodPalletWeight with DB pallet weight pre-filled\n• Debug: tbDebug visible only when config.EnableDebuggingHelpers\n\nValidation:\n• tbSkidWeight_TextChanged → validation\n• tbPartialQty_Leave → saves partial qty\n• tbWoodPalletWeight_KeyPress/KeyUp → numeric only",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
    {
      "id": "annotation-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 520,
