      "versionNonce": 1036,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 0,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Navigation:\n• Previous → back to Pallet Quantity (enabled)\n• Next (Enter) → advances to SkidDataComplete (6)\n• Enter = Next (AcceptButton), Esc = Previous\n\nOn Next:\n1. Save SkidWeight to model\n2. If partial → save PartialQty as ClaimedQuantity\n3. If wood pallet → save wood pallet weight override\n4. Advance → SkidDataComplete (6)\n\nSpecial cases:\n• Replacement skid: forced partial, alert shown\n• Extended model: alert shown, creates dual claim\n• Wood pallet: weight override saved",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Navigation:\n• Previous → back to Pallet Quantity (enabled)\n• Next (Enter) → advances to SkidDataComplete (6)\n• Enter = Next (AcceptButton), Esc = Previous\n\nOn Next:\n1. Save SkidWeight to model\n2. If partial → save PartialQty as ClaimedQuantity\n3. If wood pallet → save wood pallet weight override\n4. Advance → SkidDataComplete (6)\n\nSpecial cases:\n• Replacement skid: forced partial, alert shown\n• Extended model: alert shown, creates dual claim\n• Wood pallet: weight override saved",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    }
  ],
